# ArtPoll (OpPoll, 0x2000): discovery.

# The minimum: version, flags, diagnostics priority.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 20 00 0e 00 00 => poll v14 flags 0x00 diag 0x00 for everyone

# Reply on change, send diagnostics at DpLow.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 20 00 0e 06 10 => poll v14 flags 0x06 diag 0x10 for everyone

# Art-Net 4 targeted: top 0x0010, bottom 0x0001, ESTA and OEM codes.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 20 00 0e 20 00 00 10 00 01 12 34 56 78 => poll v14 flags 0x20 diag 0x00 for 0:0:1..=0:1:0

# The extension without the targeted flag: not targeted.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 20 00 0e 00 00 00 10 00 01 00 00 00 00 => poll v14 flags 0x00 diag 0x00 for everyone

# Targeted, but too short to say what for: everyone.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 20 00 0e 20 00 00 => poll v14 flags 0x20 diag 0x00 for everyone
